! Part 3 — the published image is flashed back, and the same key answers again
$SEALED -p $PORT status
: pause 0.8
! Nothing was re-enrolled: same PUBKEY, same slot state, counter picked up where it left off.
$SEALED -p $PORT sign --tx tx.bin
: pause 0.8
! The gate is a property of the code, not of the device. Change the code, the key stops. Change it back, it returns.
$SEALED -p $PORT attest
: pause 1.0
